BoonDescription,"A darker resurrection than the temples offer: certain to succeed, but the dead come back enraged.",
BoonDescription,"A generous healing gift, fae-touched: your hands will not be quite steady later.",
BoonDescription,Ask for a unicorn to join your party.,
BoonDescription,Ask the fae for a favour. What you get is entirely up to her mood.,
BoonDescription,"Bathe in the etching vats. It burns, but you rise with a hide the acid cannot bite.",
BoonDescription,Bless one item in your inventory or on the ground.,Благословить одну вещь в сумке или на земле.
BoonDescription,Brew a random potion into your bottle of water.,
BoonDescription,Butcher a corpse into an easy to carry container.,
BoonDescription,Call upon the undead to fight for you.,
BoonDescription,Consult the observatory's charts for the full layout of this level.,
BoonDescription,Convert one item into a random alternative of the same type.,
BoonDescription,Determine the enchantment and charges of all carried items.,
BoonDescription,"Drill under the captain's eye. You may be quickened, or you may be worn out.",
BoonDescription,Drink the warrior's drink and fight in a berserker rage. It does not spare your allies.,
BoonDescription,"Eat at the fae table. You will not go hungry, but the wine shows you things that are not there.",
BoonDescription,"Erase the magic from a potion, scroll or book.",
BoonDescription,Fall into a trance and see through walls and floors for a time.,
BoonDescription,Hatch an egg and become a parent.,
BoonDescription,Have the efreeti bind a captive elemental to your service.,
BoonDescription,"Have the temple armour smiths put a keener edge on one weapon, magical or not.",
BoonDescription,Have the wizard read the true nature of everything you carry.,
BoonDescription,"Have your destiny read from the stars, hastening your growth.",
BoonDescription,Heal damage and recover mana for yourself and your steed if mounted.,Виелечить урон вам и вашему скакуну (если верхом).
BoonDescription,Learn how to cast a random spell.,
BoonDescription,Learn the divine status of all carried items.,Узнать духовный статус всех несомых вещей.
BoonDescription,Learn the name of one random unknown item.,
BoonDescription,Make an imitation copy of an item.,
BoonDescription,Partially recharge a spent item.,
BoonDescription,Petition the vizier for a spectral cat to guard you as it once guarded the tomb.,
BoonDescription,Place a curse on one equipped or carried item.,Наложить проклятие на одну надетую или несомую вещь.
BoonDescription,"Plunge into the quenching trough. It burns with cold, but you rise proof against it.",
BoonDescription,Reanimate a corpse as a loyal revenant.,
BoonDescription,Receive the linen wrappings used to prepare the dead for the afterlife.,
BoonDescription,Remove all magic from an item.,
BoonDescription,Remove the curse on one equipped or carried item.,Снять проклятие с одной надетой или несомой вещи.
BoonDescription,Rename an item for vanity and as a small protection against cancellation.,
BoonDescription,Request a fresh corpse with no questions asked.,
BoonDescription,Request one cast of the polymorph spell.,
BoonDescription,Requisition soldiers from the garrison to march at your side.,
BoonDescription,Restore any lost ability and remove any negative transient conditions.,Восстановить любую утраченную характеристику и снять любые временные негативные условия.
BoonDescription,Return a corpse back to life.,Вернуть труп к жизни.
BoonDescription,Stand in the temple square and receive the captain's defensive blessing.,
BoonDescription,"Step into the forge fire. It burns, but you rise with fire in your blood.",
BoonDescription,Summon a powerful steed from the underworld.,
BoonDescription,Summon a tame forest beast as your ally.,
BoonDescription,Summon an escort from the pharaoh's retinue to walk beside you.,
BoonDescription,The princess trades you a measure of charm. Something else must give way for it.,
BoonDescription,The princess trades you a measure of grace. Something else must give way for it.,
BoonDescription,The princess trades you a measure of wit. Something else must give way for it.,
BoonDescription,Toss a coal on the forge fire and take whatever ward it grants you.,
BoonDescription,Train under a veteran until a weapon or armour discipline sticks.,
BoonDescription,Upgrade an item or increase its power.,
BoonDescription,Use nature magic to grow the power of your ally.,
BoonDescription,Watch the level through the great lens and mark every creature on it.,
BoonDescription,Whisper a question into the vault. The dead do not always tell the truth.,
BoonDescription,Write a random scroll onto your blank paper.,
