ItemDescription,"A band of twisted iron studded with inward-facing barbs, uncomfortable to wear but said to sharpen the wearer's aim.",
ItemDescription,"A barbed iron hook on a long coil of rope, thrown out and hauled back in.",
ItemDescription,"A battleaxe of rose gold, enormous and impractical, carried by someone with more household than sense.",
ItemDescription,"A black rune-etched blade that whispers to its wielder, a hunger that is never sated. It drinks the life of whoever it cuts down, and the stolen years flow into the one who carries it.",
ItemDescription,"A bolt with an adamantine head, made to open the armour that other bolts merely dent.",
ItemDescription,"A branched silver candle-holder, its every arm lit at once.",
ItemDescription,"A broad, straight-edged sword of Indian pattern, its hilt guard curved up to protect the knuckles.",
ItemDescription,"A canvas roll of bandages, salves and sutures for treating wounds in the field.",
ItemDescription,"A cavalry sabre in rose gold: curved, gleaming, and never once blooded.",
ItemDescription,"A ceremonial double-bitted axe, its twin blades curved like a crescent moon.",
ItemDescription,"A cloak of heavy cloth dyed a deep, uniform crimson, the mark of a self-styled captain or a travelling noble.",
ItemDescription,"A closed great helm forged from a single adamantine shell, hiding the wearer's face entirely.",
ItemDescription,A cloth mask that completely obstructs the wearer's vision.,
ItemDescription,"A collection of utensils, including empty tins and butchering tools, for packing corpses so as to condense them.",
ItemDescription,A compact hand-held firearm.,
ItemDescription,"A crudely hammered throwing disc with a jagged, uneven rim, more likely to tear than to cut cleanly.",
ItemDescription,"A curved funerary blade inlaid with gold, once carried by a pharaonic guardian charged with keeping the dead in their tombs.",
ItemDescription,"A curved single-edged blade mounted on a long oaken shaft, prized by the warrior monks of the far east.",
ItemDescription,"A curved single-edged blade often used by cavalry, especially effective against creatures of the netherworld.",
ItemDescription,A curved single-edged blade often used by cavalry.,
ItemDescription,A curved yellow fruit and a great source of fibre.,
ItemDescription,"A duelling blade of mithril: quick past the guard, and quicker back.",
ItemDescription,A duelling rapier of rose gold. It settles questions of standing far more often than questions of life.,
ItemDescription,A fine-grained stone for putting an edge back on a tired blade.,
ItemDescription,"A finely balanced throwing ring of wood-sheathed steel, prized by elven skirmishers for its silent flight.",
ItemDescription,"A flail with a gilded head, made to be carried in procession behind somebody important.",
ItemDescription,A flat black stone used since antiquity to tell real gemstones from paste and glass.,
ItemDescription,"A flat throwing weapon made of wood, often used for hunting.",
ItemDescription,"A flat, round cake. Cooked in a pan, as you might presume.",
ItemDescription,"A flattened fighting ring, its outer edge honed to a razor finish, thrown with a spinning flick of the wrist.",
ItemDescription,A foreign device which creates perfect visual depictions of reality.,
ItemDescription,"A full harness of rose gold, made for a coronation and worn exactly once. Every plate is signed on the inside by the smith who beat it.",
ItemDescription,A gilded trident from some temple to the sea. The prongs bend if you lean on them.,
ItemDescription,"A gilded, flat-bladed digging spade, its edge blunt but its weight considerable.",
ItemDescription,"A gnarled druidic cudgel that hums faintly with the pulse of living wood, said to channel the life-force of the earth back into its wielder.",
ItemDescription,A gold whistle on a fine chain. The note is no better than tin's and the price is considerably worse.,
ItemDescription,A greatsword a strong child could lift and an adult could swing all day. Mithril forgives the arms what it does not forgive the enemy.,
ItemDescription,A hand-held brass horn.,
ItemDescription,"A hard rock, smooth and therefore aerodynamic.",
ItemDescription,A hardwood pole. It is an unassuming but formidable weapon in trained hands.,
ItemDescription,"A hearty, multi-portioned and nutritious vegetarian meal.",
ItemDescription,"A heavy and long double-edged blade. Similar to a long sword, scaled-up specifically for two-handed usage.",
ItemDescription,A heavy iron hammer designed specifically for use in melee combat.,Тяжёлый железен чук разработан специально для ближнего боя.
ItemDescription,A heavy suit of armour made up of many strips of metal.,
ItemDescription,"A helm of adamantine: heavy, unlovely, and proof against the blow that would otherwise have ended things.",
ItemDescription,"A helmet beaten from gold, worn for the crowd rather than the melee. It turns the sun beautifully and a blade not at all.",
ItemDescription,"A helmet of rose gold, the copper in the alloy giving it a warmth that plain gold never has. It is still gold underneath, and still no use in a fight.",
ItemDescription,"A hollowed dragon's horn, carved with old runes. Blowing it lets loose a gout of flame.",
ItemDescription,"A horizontal, mechanically-aided bow and arrow with a shoulder stock.",
ItemDescription,A key designed to open all mundane locks.,
ItemDescription,A lance tipped with adamantine. Shields do not stop it; they only decide where it comes through.,
ItemDescription,"A leather pouch mounted at the tip of a long wooden staff, letting the wielder put both arms into the throw.",
ItemDescription,"A leather pouch set between two cords, meant for launching small projectiles.",
ItemDescription,"A length of pine still sticky with resin, cut and polished in a hurry.",
ItemDescription,"A length of sturdy rope with a clasp, for keeping a tame animal close at hand.",
ItemDescription,"A lightweight protective panel strapped to the forearm, made from wood with metal reinforcement.",
ItemDescription,"A lone, unblinking eye. Swallowing it whole is unpleasant, but not without its uses.",
ItemDescription,A long cane rod strung with line and hook. Best used beside open water.,
ItemDescription,"A long ceremonial scepter with a thunderbolt head at either end, swung two-handed.",
ItemDescription,"A long iron knife with a sharp tip, weighted for throwing.",Длинный железен нож хорошо сбалансирован для метания.
ItemDescription,A long pipe meant for shooting darts through force of breath.,
ItemDescription,"A long sword of rose gold, the copper in the alloy giving it a blush the smiths were proud of.",
ItemDescription,A long thrusting polearm best suited to mounted combat.,Копьё с длинным древком наиболее пригодно для борьбы в устойчивой позиции.
ItemDescription,A long-shafted arrow with a distinctive tip.,
ItemDescription,"A long, flexible leather thong. Unexpectedly sharp.",
ItemDescription,"A long, flowing garment, with long sleeves and a hood.",
ItemDescription,A mace that is spiked on its head.,
ItemDescription,"A massive adamantine maul, its head as large as a barrel stave, that shrugs off the recoil of its own swing.",
ItemDescription,"A massive, mithril-shod maul, its head as large as a barrel stave.",
ItemDescription,A meal made from the stomach lining of an animal.,
ItemDescription,"A miniature crossbow of elven design, light enough to be drawn and fired one-handed without a stirrup.",
ItemDescription,"A monstrous greatsword forged with three parallel blades fused along a single spine, each edge catching the light at a different angle.",
ItemDescription,"A package of preserved meats, all dried and chewy.",
ItemDescription,"A pair of gauntlets ringed with jagged knuckle-spikes, made to turn a punch into a wound.",
ItemDescription,A pair of solid iron-plated boots that guard the shin and instep at the cost of a good deal of weight.,
ItemDescription,A pair of sturdy leather boots which extend upward until just below the knee.,
ItemDescription,A pair of sturdy leather boots which extend upwards to just above the ankle.,
ItemDescription,"A pair of well-tailored leather boots, dyed and stitched more for looking good than for taking a beating.",
ItemDescription,"A parade shield of gold, embossed with somebody's arms. It is carried on the left because that is the side the crowd stands on.",
ItemDescription,"A parade sword of gold, kept bright and never once sharpened.",
ItemDescription,"A plain gold band with no beginning and no visible seam, warm to the touch as if something inside it never stops moving.",
ItemDescription,"A plain staff of adamantine: unremarkable to look at, and impossible to snap.",
ItemDescription,"A plain, undyed shirt of woven cloth, worn under armour or on its own.",
ItemDescription,"A pointed iron bar fashioned at a right-angle to a sturdy wooden handle, used to pierce through hard surfaces.",
ItemDescription,A pointed metal cylinder meant to be discharged from a firearm.,
ItemDescription,"A poleaxe whose head weighs almost nothing, so the swing goes where it is aimed rather than where it falls.",
ItemDescription,A polished sheet of silvered glass. Some things recoil from their own reflection.,
ItemDescription,A portable source of light fashioned out of copper and fuelled by oil.,
ItemDescription,A projectile consisting of a wooden shaft with a sharp metal tip at its front and stabilising fins at its rear.,
ItemDescription,A righteous sword forged by a revered blacksmith many years ago who set out to hone his craft and to create the ultimate blade. The noble intent of its creator lingers in this weapon to cut down the wicked and protect the innocent.,
ItemDescription,A ring of nine facets with no beginning and no end. The wearer's life loops rather than ends.,
ItemDescription,"A rose-gold hatchet, balanced for throwing by someone who was never going to throw it.",
ItemDescription,A rose-gold shield with a mirror finish. Its owner spent more time looking at it than behind it.,
ItemDescription,"A rose-gold spear carried at the head of processions, point up, so that nobody has to look at it closely.",
ItemDescription,"A sacrificial dagger of soft gold, meant for the altar rather than the field.",
ItemDescription,"A sanctimonious biscuit. A miracle to the meek, a scourge to the undead.",
ItemDescription,"A semi-rigid weapon made up of a notched wooden shaft with a drawstring attached to both ends, used to launch arrows.",
ItemDescription,"A shard of the night sky, showing the wearer what is hidden, what is coming, and what others think.",
ItemDescription,A sharp iron wedge fashioned to a sturdy handle.,
ItemDescription,"A sharp metal throwing weapon, smaller than a hand and shaped like a star.",
ItemDescription,"A shield faced with a single sheet of adamantine. It does not dent, and the arm behind it feels every blow it does not let through.",
ItemDescription,A short and light double-edged blade.,
ItemDescription,"A short ceremonial scepter cast in the shape of a thunderbolt, wielded as a mace.",
ItemDescription,"A short sword of rose gold, sized for a courtier's belt and a courtier's quarrel.",
ItemDescription,"A short wand carved into a grinning face, the sort a street conjurer waves about before the trick.",
ItemDescription,"A sickle-sword of the old kingdoms, its outer edge sharpened into a hook.",
ItemDescription,"A sleeveless cloth garment worn over armour, its blank front begging for a coat of arms.",
ItemDescription,"A slim rose-gold dagger, warm to the touch and made to be seen being carried.",
ItemDescription,"A slimy, scaly sea creature, in its entirety. Good for a meal.",
ItemDescription,A small cutting utensil made of metal with a wooden handle.,
ItemDescription,A small glass vial holding a captive mote of light.,
ItemDescription,A small iron tool designed for opening all sorts of locks.,
ItemDescription,A small missile with a pointed tip meant for throwing.,
ItemDescription,A small missile with a reservoir of liquid delivered through a hollow pointed tip.,
ItemDescription,"A small, smooth grey stone that feels warm to the touch. Fortune favours whoever carries it.",
ItemDescription,"A snugly fitted, padded jacket buttoned up the front, the sort of thing a merchant or a minor noble might wear.",
ItemDescription,"A soft-brimmed hat, somewhat out of fashion.",
ItemDescription,A sophisticated bludgeon with a heavy iron head.,
ItemDescription,A spacious bag made of incredibly stretchy cotton.,
ItemDescription,A spacious cloth bag.,
ItemDescription,"A staff of living, unworked rock. What shapes matter cannot itself be unmade.",
ItemDescription,"A star of mithril, so light that it seems to hang in the air a moment before it arrives.",
ItemDescription,A stick of cured meat.,
ItemDescription,"A stick of highly explosive material, with a short fuse on one end.",
ItemDescription,A stone infused with restorative magic. It crumbles a little more each time it is used.,
ItemDescription,A stone so black it seems to swallow the light around it. Some say it lets you see by its own darkness.,
ItemDescription,"A straight, double-edged and often cruciform blade.",
ItemDescription,A sturdy and solid mineral.,
ItemDescription,A suit of armour made from metal rings sewn onto a foundation of leather or cloth.,"Кольчуга состоит из тканевой или кожаной основы, на которую индивидуально крепятся металлические кольца."
ItemDescription,"A suit of plate armour beaten from solid gold, prized by kings who never expect to take a blow.",
ItemDescription,"A surviving portion of the legendary wall of Verimurus, an ancient elven city said to have lasted since time immemorial. However, not even the mightiest walls could withstand the endless onslaught of the dragons. Now the enchanted walls stand alone over the land that once held them.",
ItemDescription,"A sweet citrus fruit, coloured eponymously.",
ItemDescription,"A sweet custard-filled pie with a thin crust, topped with whipped cream.",
ItemDescription,"A sweet, round fruit, of the red variety. Reportedly a great supplement to your physical health.",
ItemDescription,"A sword whose blade is a long, flexible ribbon of metal, coiled like a belt when not in use.",
ItemDescription,"A tall, asymmetric bow.",
ItemDescription,"A thick leather coat, constructed to withstand weather and wear.",
ItemDescription,"A thick wooden bludgeon. What it lacks in style, it makes up for in function.",
ItemDescription,"A thin and agile sword meant almost exclusively for thrusting, its blade cast in silver and folded steel.",
ItemDescription,A thin and agile sword meant almost exclusively for thrusting.,
ItemDescription,"A thin broth that sits in the stomach like a full meal. It tastes of nothing whatsoever, which is the price of never having to stop and eat.",
ItemDescription,A throwing hatchet of mithril. It flies flatter and further than its weight suggests it should.,
ItemDescription,A throwing ring of gold. It returns beautifully and cuts adequately.,
ItemDescription,A tremendous two-handed blade whose sheer momentum can bowl over anything caught in its swing.,
ItemDescription,"A two-handed firearm, steadied at the shoulder, often used in small game hunting. It packs quite a punch.",
ItemDescription,"A wand that splits into two prongs at the tip, like a diviner's rod that never did find water.",
ItemDescription,"A wonder of dwarven ingenuity and craftsmanship, stolen and repurposed by orcs. Mounted on a long shaft, this tool is a formidable weapon on horseback or warg-back. The electrical current that powers its drill will occasionally discharge on whomever is willing to stand in the way of this monstrosity.",
ItemDescription,Adamantine cannot be dulled and will not break. The blade will outlast whoever is carrying it.,
ItemDescription,"Adamantine stars, thrown a thousand times and recovered a thousand times. Nothing they strike blunts them.",
ItemDescription,Agricultural implement consisting of a long curving blade and fastened to an angled handle.,
ItemDescription,An ambiguous curiosity. It seems edible.,
ItemDescription,An article of leather clothing covering the torso that hangs around the neck and on the shoulders.,
ItemDescription,An article of waterproof cotton clothing covering the torso that hangs around the neck and on the shoulders.,
ItemDescription,"An early hand cannon that sparks its own charge with a spinning steel wheel, saving its user from carrying a lit match.",
ItemDescription,An elven travel food. It is incredibly satiating.,
ItemDescription,"An enormous sword of solid gold, more monument than weapon, and worth a small estate.",
ItemDescription,"An enormous two-handed hammer, its iron head wide enough to crack shields and crush breastplates in a single swing.",
ItemDescription,An extremely sharp little blade used for precise incisions.,
ItemDescription,An inconspicuous snack that tells deep secrets.,
ItemDescription,An iron projectile made up of a shaft with a sharpened square-pyramid tip.,
ItemDescription,"An omen of your own death, worn openly. You always sense it coming, but so does everyone standing near you.",
ItemDescription,"An orange root-vegetable, commonly believed to improve eyesight.",
ItemDescription,"An unremarkable grey rock, deceptively heavy for its size. It is not one you want to be caught carrying.",
ItemDescription,"Articulated adamantine over a leather glove. Nothing you catch in your hand will cut it, which has settled more than one argument about knives.",
ItemDescription,"Boiled leather, moulded into a bodily shape to be donned as light armour.",
ItemDescription,"Bold, or just tacky?",
ItemDescription,Boots shod in adamantine. They are as heavy as the iron pair and will still be whole long after the feet inside them are not.,
ItemDescription,"Ceremonial gauntlets of soft gold. They mark the wearer's rank, and they mark very easily.",
ItemDescription,Chain mail consists of a mesh of metal rings interlinked to form a flexible armour.,"Кольчуга состоит из связанных между собой металлических колец, образующих гибкую броню."
ItemDescription,"Drinking it leaves a cold spot at the back of the neck, and the spot grows colder the closer danger comes.",
ItemDescription,"Fate itself bends around the wearer, keeping them exactly where the blow cannot land.",
ItemDescription,"Fine mithril mail worked into a glove, close enough to the hand that you can still feel what you are holding.",
ItemDescription,Folded mithril holds an edge that no whetstone has ever had to touch. The smiths who made it are long dead.,
ItemDescription,"Forged deep underground by dwarven hands, this blade was made to slay the scaled beasts who sought to steal their treasures. Throughout the long years this blade has bathed in the blood of its winged prey. Now almost forgotten, it yearns again for the taste of dragon flesh.",
ItemDescription,"Gazing into its crimson depths you can see the concentrated life essence of countless victims swirling inside of it. The artifact was completed in the moment of the creators' death, as his soul was claimed by his creation. Now residing among the souls of his former victims, his essence as an alchemist provides the stone with ultimate transmutative powers.",
ItemDescription,"Gilded boots for standing in, at the top of steps, while somebody reads something out at length.",
ItemDescription,"Gold is far too soft to hold an edge, but it is worth more than the fight. Ceremonial, and traded rather more often than it is swung.",
ItemDescription,"Indra's thunderbolt, forged to slay the asuras. Its wielder is proof against the storm, and every solid blow can arc into a crackling, stunning discharge.",
ItemDescription,Its high-quality elvish manufacture makes for an effective close combat weapon.,Виесококлассные елфийские мастера создали это эффективное в ближнем бою оружие.
ItemDescription,Leather armour with close-set studs so as to offer more protection.,
ItemDescription,"Like a smaller variant of the katana, often used as a side-arm.",
ItemDescription,Mithril takes an edge that steel cannot hold and weighs a third as much. The head barely tires the arm between swings.,
ItemDescription,"Odin's own spear, said never to miss its mark. Hurled at a foe it strikes true and returns to the hand that threw it, wreathed in a force no shield can turn aside.",
ItemDescription,One segment of a particularly pungent and bulbous herb.,
ItemDescription,"Rose gold takes an edge no better than gold does, but it looks magnificent failing to.",
ItemDescription,"Rose gold, alloyed with copper for a warmer colour and a little more spine than gold alone.",
ItemDescription,"Rose-gold boots, chased with vine work down the shin. They were made to be looked at from below, on a dais.",
ItemDescription,"Rose-gold gauntlets with articulated fingers, delicate enough to hold a cup and useless for holding a line.",
ItemDescription,Shoes of mithril plate over a soft lining. They weigh less than the leather pair they replace and will never rust through.,
ItemDescription,Standard issue protective metal headgear.,
ItemDescription,"Stormbringer's twin, forged of the same black iron. Where its sibling drinks blood, this blade drinks the mind, and those it does not kill outright it bends to serve a new master.",
ItemDescription,"Sturdy leather garments fitted firm onto the hands, sheathing each finger individually.",
ItemDescription,The final sword forged by a once respected blacksmith who lost himself in the depths of the dungeon. His warped soul now inhabits this blade and lusts for blood. It is said that the one who wields this sword is coerced into cutting down friend and foe alike.,
ItemDescription,"The head is adamantine and the haft is merely wood, so the haft is what usually fails first.",
ItemDescription,The head of a ranseur consists of a spear-tip affixed with a cross hilt at its base.,"Верхушка рунки состоит из лезвия копья, закреплённой на поперечной рукояти."
ItemDescription,The only coin that can be found and spent in the dungeon.,В подземелье можно найти и потратить только мобезы.
ItemDescription,The snipped segment of a plant known for its antilycanthropic properties.,
ItemDescription,"The spiral horn of a unicorn, its magic bound permanently into the artifact rather than spent in a single burst.",
ItemDescription,The wearer will occasionally fly into uncontrollable rage lashing out at both friend and foe.,"Носящий будет время от времени бросаться в ярости на окружающих, будь то друзья или враги."
ItemDescription,This ancient artifact is a marvel to behold with exquisite craftsmanship and unbridled digging power.,Това ет чудесный древний артефакт демонстрирует искусную работу мастеров и необузданную мощь при копании.
ItemDescription,"This axe is specifically designed to facilitate deep, grievous wounds in combat. This large weapon is wielded in both hands.","Това ет брадва специально разработан, чтобы наносить чудовищные и глубокие раны в бою. это большое оружие удерживается двумя руками."
ItemDescription,"This compact, dwarvish manufactured spear is ideal for close quarters combat.",Това е компактное копие дварфского производства идеально для боя в закрытых помещениях.
ItemDescription,This convenient vial of ink can be used to replenish your markers.,
ItemDescription,This crudely made blade is still an effective throwing weapon.,Това е грубо сделанное лезвие по прежнему является эффективным оружием для метания.
ItemDescription,This curious artifact somehow chastens those it strikes and submits them to your will.,"Това ет любопытный артефакт как-то наказывает тех, кого поражает и предоставляет их Вашей воле."
ItemDescription,This dwarvish manufactured sword is sturdy and suited to being wielded in the offhand.,Това ет джуджешки меч довольно прочен и пригоден для неподготовленных бойцов.
ItemDescription,"This dwarvish punching blade is forged thicker than most, its crossbar reinforced to survive a full-strength thrust.",
ItemDescription,This gemstone is made from hardened tree sap.,Това ет драгоценный камень сформировался из затвердевшей смолы дерева.
ItemDescription,This glowing looking glass reveals glimpses of the future and corrupts your soul.,
ItemDescription,This hammer is a four-pronged head mounted atop a long polearm stick. It bears a long spike on its reverse and an even longer spike extending from the very top. It proves effective at puncturing or smashing armour as well as dismounting riders.,"Това ет чук состоит из головки с четырьмя остриями, установленной на длинной рукояти. На обратной стороне находится длинный шип и ещё более длинный, как продолжение рукояти. Това е оружие очень эффективно при прокалывании или разбиванию брони, или же при сбрасывании всадников с седла."
ItemDescription,This handy canister of oil can be used to refuel your lamps and lanterns.,Эта ручная канистра с маслом может быть использована для заправки ламп.
ItemDescription,This high-quality elven manufactured dagger is perfectly weighted for throwing.,Това ет высококачественный елвски кинжал отлично сбалансирован для метания.
ItemDescription,This is a curved blade put atop a long pole. The blade is moderately curved along its length with the cutting edge only on the concave side.,Това е изогнутое лезвие установлено поверх длинной рукояти. Оно умеренно изогнуто по всей своей длине и имеют режущий край только с внутренней стороны.
ItemDescription,This is a light spear designed to be thrown by hand.,Това е лёгкое копие разработано для метания.
ItemDescription,This is a pole weapon consisting of a modified hammer head and spike mounted atop a long pole.,"Това е оружие состоит из длинного шеста, с чуком и шипом на конце."
ItemDescription,"This is a pole weapon with a long, cleaver type blade.","Това е оружие представляет из себя длинное и широкое лезвие, установленное на шест."
ItemDescription,This is a potion of pure magical energy which will restore and increase your mana.,"Това е отвара полно магической энергии, восстанавливающей и увеличивающей Вашу ману."
ItemDescription,This is a sharp and curved single-edged blade with a circular guard and long grip.,"Това е острый и изогнутый длинный меч с односторонним лезвием, имеющий круглую гарду и удлинённую рукоятку."
ItemDescription,This is a sword weapon with a long curved design.,Това е длинный меч с изогнутым лезвием.
ItemDescription,This is a two-handed pole weapon consisting of an axe blade with a spike mounted on a long shaft.,"Това е двуручное оружие состоит из лезвия брадваа и наконечника копья, установленных на длинном шесте."
ItemDescription,This light blade of elvish manufacture is particularly suited as an offhand weapon.,Това е лёгкое елфийское лезвие особенно подходит для неподготовленных воинов.
ItemDescription,This magical pen has only a limited amount of ink. It seems to vibrate and move on its own accord when you hold it in your hand. You wonder what it would do if you pressed it to some paper.,"Эта магическая ручка имеет Шреканиченное количество чернил. Кажется, она вибрирует и движется по собственной воле, когато вы держите её в своей руке."
ItemDescription,This old katana has been battered and broken through a million battles. Hardly more than a scrap of metal and wood and yet it flickers with a strange power.,
ItemDescription,This powerful artifact blade glows with a holy fury that lights the area.,Това ет могущественный артефактный меч освещает божественным светом область вокруг.
ItemDescription,This powerful magic can be used to create copies of any item.,Эта могущественная магия может быть использована для копирования любых вещей.
ItemDescription,This ring augments the damage caused by your strikes,Това е пръстен увеличивает урон наносимых вами ударов.
ItemDescription,"This tool is used for digging and chopping, similar to the pick-axe. It has a long handle and a stout head, which combines an axe blade and an adze. It can also be used as an effective melee weapon.","Това ет инструмент используется для раскопок и рубки деревьев, подобно киркомотыге. Так же он может пригодиться как эффективное оружие ближнего боя."
ItemDescription,This utility scroll restores some of the charges to your spent wands and tools.,Това ет полезный свитък восстанавливает некоторое количество зарядов в Ваших пръчках и инструментах.
ItemDescription,"This weapon consists of a hooked chopping blade with several pointed projections mounted on a staff. The end of the cutting blade curves forward to form a hook. In addition, the blade has one pronounced spike straight off the top like a spear head and also a hook or spike mounted on the reverse side of the blade.","Това е оружие состоит из загнутого широкого лезвия с несколькими острыми выступами, смонтированного на посох. Конец лезвия загинается вперёд, образуя форму крючка. Вдобавок, лезвие имеет острый наконечник и шип с обратной стороны."
ItemDescription,This weapon consists of a large blade on the end of a long pole. The blade is affixed in a socket-shaft configuration similar to an axe head.,"Това е оружие состоит из гигантского лезвия, установленного на конце длинного шеста. Лезвие крепится отдельно, подобно головной части брадваа."
ItemDescription,This weapon consists of a long pole with a mounted a spear head and two projections at its base.,Това е оружие состоит из длинного шеста с копейным наконечником и двумя выступами в его основании.
ItemDescription,This weapon consists of a single-edged blade on the end of a pole.,"Това е оружие состоит из одностороннего лезвия, установленного на конце шеста."
ItemDescription,This weapon consists of a spearhead mounted on a long wooden shaft with protrusions on the sides which aided in parrying sword thrusts.,"Това е оружие состоит из наконечника копья, установленного на длинный деревянный шест с выступами по бокам, которые помогают парировать удары меча."
ItemDescription,"This weapon is a curved blade attached to a pole by binding the lower two-thirds of the blade to the side of the pole, to form a sort of axe.","Това е оружие представляет собой изогнутое лезвие, установленного на шест, продлевающийся на две третьих лезвия, образуя форму, схожую с брадваом."
ItemDescription,This withered hand is the last remnant of an ancient and powerful lich.,
ItemDescription,Three mithril prongs on a slender shaft. It goes through mail with very little behind it.,
ItemDescription,Tiny metal spikes thrown to the ground to impede mobility.,
ItemDescription,"Two prongs of rose gold on a polished haft: a ceremonial guard's weapon, and unmistakably so.",
ItemDescription,"Vishnu's own discus, a spinning wheel of golden light famed for cutting through anything it is thrown at. It is the classic bane of demons.",
ItemDescription,Winged sandals made of imperishable gold which fly the wearer swiftly and silently.,
ItemDescription,Zapping it at a wall creates a big tunnel.,Взмах этим в сторону стены создаст голямо тоннель.
