ModuleDescription,Descend through procedurally generated dungeons and caverns. Infinite re-playability and recommended for players new to Pathos.,"Спуститесь в процедурно-сгенерированные подземелья и пещеры. Бесконечная реиграбельность, рекомендуется для новичков в Pathos."
ModuleDescription,"Explore a vast, procedurally generated overland map containing side dungeons, elaborate set pieces and intriguing encounters.",
ModuleDescription,Hand-designed maps in an epic overland adventure. Take a break from the confines of the dungeon and embark on a challenging quest.,Созданные вручную карты для приключений на поверхности. Виейдите за границы подземелий и приступайте к выполнению Квеста.
ModuleDescription,Interesting rooms and secrets await but do not linger; you must descend or die. Based on the map generation from Shattered Pixel Dungeon.,
ModuleDescription,"Sandbox for experimenting with the mechanics of Pathos. Play with every item, trap and dungeon feature in a simple two room map.","Песочница для экспериментов с игровой механикой Pathos. Поиграйте с каждой вещью, капанми и подземными механизмами на простой двухкомнатной карте."
ModuleDialogue,Any news from the surface? I've been down here so long that I miss sunshine and weather.,
ModuleDialogue,Did you know that half of what the merchants sell is sourced from the corpses of adventurers like you?,
ModuleDialogue,Everyone is talking about an orcish invasion but I don't believe it will ever happen.,
ModuleDialogue,Goodbye.,
ModuleDialogue,Have you noticed that there's too many gnomes around here?,
ModuleDialogue,I can't believe I have to explain this but make sure you have a pick-axe before going into the mines. You can even craft one at the town workbench with plenty of scrap iron.,
ModuleDialogue,"I don't know why adventurers think they can shoot, shoot, shoot around the town with their arrows and darts. We are fed up with it, so even an accidental strike on our townsfolk will be met with deadly force.",
ModuleDialogue,"I swear you adventurers are harbingers of misfortune! Every time one of you degenerates turns up, we lose a dozen men.",
ModuleDialogue,I'm tired and my feet hurt! I can't wait for this patrol to be over so I can go to bed.,
ModuleDialogue,"I've been told that there is a dwarven city underneath the gnomish mines. That's not a journey I will ever want to take - too many smelly, short people down there for my liking.",
ModuleDialogue,"Keep an eye out for illusionary cave walls because pesky gnomish wizards have been at work recently. Absolute pests, the lot of them.",
ModuleDialogue,Make sure you trade with the town merchants and support the local economy! I wouldn't recommend doing it on an empty stomach though.,
ModuleDialogue,"Sometimes, powerful and famous heroes from across the lands grace us with their presence... I'll let you know if I see one today.",
ModuleDialogue,Stay out of my way! I'm on an important patrol and you adventurers are always blocking my path.,
ModuleDialogue,"The **Oracle** stares at you in mute sympathy, entirely unnerving you with her sorrowful expression.||Fate must have something truly *unpleasant* planned for you.",
ModuleDialogue,The food is so lousy here. Why do you think we kill monsters and have that workbench in the middle of town?,
ModuleDialogue,The mines are a dangerous place to travel alone so you should consider hiring some of the local mercenaries to help you out. Be aware though that they are only reliable up until your coin runs out.,
ModuleDialogue,"The town shrine offers many boons to the virtuous adventurer, make sure you visit today and donate any spare coins. Bless you adventurer on your travels!",
ModuleDialogue,"The Watch and the Merchant Guild have a long-standing agreement, so don't get any funny ideas.",
ModuleDialogue,"There's a gem-rush going on in the mines below town. Expensive gemstones just lying around, not the usual worthless pieces of glass!",
ModuleDialogue,There's a staircase to the mines in the caves outside of town. Maybe you should go down and never come back?,
ModuleDialogue,This is my last patrol before my retirement from the Watch. I sure hope nothing untoward happens!,
ModuleDialogue,"This town is a wonderful place to spend time and prepare yourself for your journey ahead. Don't be in a rush to leave here, there's plenty of things to see and do before you delve further into the dungeon.",
ModuleDialogue,"Watch your step when you first enter the mines, those sneaky gnomish bastards love to ambush an unprepared adventurer.",
ModuleDialogue,Why don't you go play in the caves outside of town? There's lots of free stuff to collect but be aware that we don't patrol outside of town so make sure you can run back if you get into any trouble.,
ModuleDialogue,Will you please stop playing in the fountains. I'm not allowed to get this uniform wet so if you splash me I swear: *I will end you.*,
ModuleDialogue,"You know, I once was an adventurer like you... maybe you should get a job as well? After all, *adventurer* is just a fancy way of saying homeless and unemployed.",
